WEBVTT

00:00:57.719 --> 00:00:59.888
MORETON DALE

00:01:08.522 --> 00:01:09.773
-(BOTH GRUNTING)
-I'm so sorry. Sorry.

00:01:12.234 --> 00:01:13.318
Hey!

00:01:14.152 --> 00:01:15.487
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:01:20.283 --> 00:01:21.368
(CASE THUDS)

00:01:24.538 --> 00:01:25.664
(OPENS CASE)

00:01:27.457 --> 00:01:28.708
NEWT: Dear Mr. Kowalski.

00:01:29.084 --> 00:01:31.545
You are wasted in a canning factory.

00:01:34.798 --> 00:01:38.176
Please take these Occamy eggshells
as collateral for your bakery.

00:01:38.343 --> 00:01:39.845
A well-wisher.

00:01:44.391 --> 00:01:45.559
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:01:56.361 --> 00:01:57.362
(SIGHS)

00:02:01.533 --> 00:02:02.617
Well...

00:02:03.535 --> 00:02:05.871
-It's been, um--
-Hasn't it?

00:02:10.041 --> 00:02:11.751
Listen, Newt, uh...

00:02:12.711 --> 00:02:14.254
I wanted to thank you.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:16.214
What on earth for?

00:02:17.257 --> 00:02:18.550
Well, you know...

00:02:19.467 --> 00:02:21.720
If you hadn't said all those nice things
to Madam Picquery about me,

00:02:21.887 --> 00:02:24.514
I wouldn't be back
on the investigative team now.

00:02:26.057 --> 00:02:29.352
I can't think of anyone
that I'd rather have investigating me.

00:02:32.314 --> 00:02:34.482
Try not to need investigating for a bit.

00:02:34.649 --> 00:02:35.650
I will.

00:02:36.109 --> 00:02:38.486
A quiet life for me from now on.

00:02:38.653 --> 00:02:39.988
Back to the Ministry.

00:02:40.238 --> 00:02:41.615
Deliver my manuscript.

00:02:41.907 --> 00:02:43.408
I'll look out for it.

00:02:43.909 --> 00:02:46.786
Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them.

00:02:52.751 --> 00:02:54.920
Does Leta Lestrange like to read?

00:02:56.129 --> 00:02:57.547
Who?

00:02:59.174 --> 00:03:01.384
The girl whose picture you carry.

00:03:03.929 --> 00:03:06.765
I don't really know
what Leta likes these days.

00:03:08.099 --> 00:03:09.726
-Oh.
-'Cause people change.

00:03:10.518 --> 00:03:12.479
-Yes.
-I've changed.

00:03:14.189 --> 00:03:15.523
I think. Uh...

00:03:16.608 --> 00:03:17.984
Maybe a little.

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:23.281
(SHIP HORN BLOWING)

00:03:27.953 --> 00:03:30.121
I'll send you a copy of my book, if I may.

00:03:30.956 --> 00:03:32.457
I'd like that.

00:03:38.838 --> 00:03:40.048
(GASPS)

00:03:50.976 --> 00:03:55.855
I'm so sorry. How would you feel
if I gave you your copy in person?

00:03:58.650 --> 00:03:59.985
I'd like that.

00:04:01.569 --> 00:04:02.570
(LAUGHS)

00:04:03.154 --> 00:04:04.781
Very much.

00:04:14.457 --> 00:04:18.420
ROYAL STAR STEAM CO.

00:04:47.532 --> 00:04:48.700
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:04:48.908 --> 00:04:53.788
ORCHARD ST.

00:04:55.707 --> 00:04:58.585
KOWALSKI
FANCY CONFECTIONS FRESH BREAD

00:04:59.669 --> 00:05:03.089
KOWALSKI
QUALITY BAKED GOODS

00:05:06.551 --> 00:05:10.055
HELP
WANTED

00:05:10.221 --> 00:05:11.765
COME IN - WE'RE
OPEN

00:05:11.973 --> 00:05:13.558
(JINGLING)

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:24.819
Where'd you get your ideas
from, Mr. Kowalski?

00:05:25.028 --> 00:05:26.696
I don't know. I don't know. (LAUGHING)

00:05:28.114 --> 00:05:29.741
They just come.

00:05:30.158 --> 00:05:32.160
Here you go. Don't forget this.

00:05:32.577 --> 00:05:33.703
Enjoy.

00:05:34.079 --> 00:05:35.747
Hey! Hendry.

00:05:35.914 --> 00:05:38.583
Storage, all right? Thanks, pal.

00:05:38.792 --> 00:05:40.543
(BELL JINGLING)

